{'symbol': 'HES', 'date': '2019-10-04 09:30:00', 'title': 'HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS TO BUY HESS INFRASTRUCTURE PARTNERS FOR $6.2 BLN', 'text': "HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP ANNOUNCES ACQUISITION OF HESS INFRASTRUCTURE PARTNERS LP, IDR SIMPLIFICATION AND CONVERSION TO AN UP-C CORPORATE STRUCTURE; PROVIDES 2020 GUIDANCE.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP ANNOUNCES ACQUISITION OF HESS INFRASTRUCTURE PARTNERS LP, IDR SIMPLIFICATION AND CONVERSION TO AN UP-C CORPORATE STRUCTURE; PROVIDES 2020 GUIDANCE.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS - WILL ACQUIRE ALL OF HESS CORPORATION'S AND GLOBAL INFRASTRUCTURE PARTNERS' OWNERSHIP INTERESTS IN HESS INFRASTRUCTURE PARTNERS LP.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP - DEAL FOR APPROXIMATELY $6.2 BILLION.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP - FULL YEAR 2020 VOLUMES ARE ANTICIPATED TO GROW SIGNIFICANTLY COMPARED TO 2019.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP - HESM WILL ASSUME APPROXIMATELY $1.15 BILLION OF EXISTING HIP DEBT.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP - DEAL EXPECTED TO BE IMMEDIATELY ACCRETIVE TO DISTRIBUTABLE CASH FLOW PER UNIT/SHARE COMMENCING WITH 6% ACCRETION IN 2020.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP - 2020 CAPITAL EXPENDITURES ARE EXPECTED TO BE APPROXIMATELY $350 MILLION.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP - PLANS TO MAINTAIN HESM'S TARGETED 15% DISTRIBUTION PER UNIT GROWTH THROUGH AT LEAST 2021.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP - HESM WILL ISSUE ABOUT 230 MILLION HESM UNITS AND PAY A CASH CONSIDERATION OF ABOUT $550 MILLION TO HESS AND GIP COLLECTIVELY.HESS MIDSTREAM PARTNERS LP - TRANSACTION EXPECTED TO BE NON-TAXABLE TO CURRENT PUBLIC UNITHOLDERS."}